        'DECIDE the peer-selling guardrail before forum member-posting (Phase 2): community & discovery only vs classifieds — affects FCA/scam-dispute exposure',
        'ACCOUNTS & MESSAGING OVERHAUL (decided 20 Aug, plan in refs). Phase A done (endorsements off). Phase B: one account with roles — Member (buys, lists the odd item) / Multi Seller (sells regularly, full dashboard) / Business (branded shopfront); everyone registers name, postcode, verified email + phone; one email-code login for all, retiring the seller password. Then C profile menu in the marketplace header, D two-way messaging + contact-sharing choices (show/hide email and phone, in-app messages otherwise), E in-app + web push notifications (no email), F admin channel-preference card.',
        'Buyer postcode at sign-up is specifically to prefill one-click SMR delivery quotes — wire it into the delivery enquiry rather than asking for a full address again',
